{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1539770-how-to-make-inverse-conditional-duration","id":1539770,"title":"How to make inverse Conditional Duration?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-08-03T17:35:58-07:00","id":1539770,"title":"How to make inverse Conditional Duration?","content":"If I want to set a trap, is there a conventional way to make like a conditional trigger? This is so that the spell is suppressed until the trigger goes off. Do I have to use Hung spell? Can any arcana use keys or just Space?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28563-hydrophiliak","name":"Hydrophiliak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar28563_1.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-03T17:46:33-07:00","id":1539771,"title":"","content":"Apart from <i>Hung Spell</i>, you can also use a <i>Basilisk </i>yantra (<i>Signs of Sorcery</i> page 53), <i>Energize Object</i>, <i>Stored Spell</i>, <i>Spell Potion</i> (<i>Signs of Sorcery</i> pages 69 and 70), as well as different ways to create cursed items (<i>Signs of Sorcery</i> page 71). Lastly, you can cast AoEs with a conjunctional <i>Warding Gesture</i> to selectively exclude authorized targets from your spells (core book page 136).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><