e-awakening/877640-creative-thaumaturgy-fallen-world-edition?p=1475721#post1475721\">a variation of <i>Spirit Manse</i> to make it into a mental Safe Space</a>. Alternatively, you could use a Weaving of Mind to close the Oneiros, so that anyone's attempt to enter would cause a Clash of Wills.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2648"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}